<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Staff Login — Alshifa Clinic</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root {
    --bg-ivory: #FBF8F5;
    --white: #FFFFFF;
    --red-deep: #6E1423;
    --red-accent: #A31D2E;
    --charcoal: #201C1B;
    --grey: #6B615E;
    --hairline: rgba(32, 28, 27, 0.14);
    --radius: 3px;
  }

  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    color: var(--charcoal);
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }

  h1, .brand { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; }

  .panel {
    position: relative;
    background:
      linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(30,10,14,0.9) 10%, rgba(110,20,35,0.55) 60%, rgba(110,20,35,0.25) 100%),
      url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1631217868264-e5b90bb7e133?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
    color: var(--white);
    padding: 48px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .panel .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 1.4rem; }
  .panel .brand .mark { width: 9px; height: 9px; background: var(--white); border-radius: 50%; }

  .panel .quote { max-width: 380px; }
  .panel .quote h2 { font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-size: 1.8rem; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .panel .quote p { color: #E7CFCF; font-size: 0.92rem; }

  .form-panel {
    background: var(--bg-ivory);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 48px;
  }

  .form-box { width: 100%; max-width: 380px; }

  .form-box .eyebrow {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--red-accent);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .form-box h1 { font-size: 1.9rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .form-box .sub { color: var(--grey); font-size: 0.92rem; margin-bottom: 32px; }

  .field { margin-bottom: 20px; }

  .field label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .field input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 13px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    background: var(--white);
    color: var(--charcoal);
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .field input:focus { border-color: var(--red-accent); }
  .field input::placeholder { color: #B0A6A4; }

  .field-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: -8px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .field-meta label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; color: var(--grey); font-weight: 400; }
  .field-meta a { color: var(--red-deep); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .field-meta a:hover { color: var(--red-accent); }

  .btn-primary {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--red-deep);
    color: var(--white);
    border: none;
    padding: 14px;
    font-size: 0.94rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--red-accent); }

  .role-note {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--grey);
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  .switch-link { text-align: center; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--grey); margin-top: 24px; }
  .switch-link a { color: var(--red-deep); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .switch-link a:hover { color: var(--red-accent); }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .panel { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="panel">
    
    <div class="quote">
      <h2>Welcome back to the front desk.</h2>
      <p>Log in with your staff account — the system knows if you're a doctor or receptionist and routes you accordingly.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-panel">
    <form action="/users/login" method="post">
    <div class="form-box">
      <span class="eyebrow">Staff Login</span>
      <h1>Log in to your account</h1>
      <p class="sub">For doctors and receptionists only.</p>

      <form id="loginForm">
        <div class="field">
          <label for="username">Username</label>
          <input type="text" id="username" name="username" placeholder="ALI" required>
        </div>

        <div class="field">
          <label for="password">Password</label>
          <input type="password" id="password" name="password" placeholder="Enter your password" required>
        </div>

        <div class="field-meta">
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="remember"> Remember me</label>
          <a href="#">Forgot password?</a>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Log In</button>
      </form>

      <p class="role-note">Your role (Doctor / Receptionist) is detected automatically after login.</p>
      <p class="switch-link">New staff member? <a href="/register">Create an account</a></p>
    </div>
    </form>
  </div>

</body>
</html>